# An X session on Dolly's display: the Xsdl server, twm managing the
# windows, and three of X's own clients in theirs: a clock, eyes that follow
# the pointer and a terminal with a shell, where imgui-x11 starts Dear ImGui's
# example in a window of its own.
FROM /v0.1.4/Dollyfile-system c70f3b842963a6101ae2699d788d6a747556ccc478af760696bf50c27043f342
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xorg-server 98858a19b9e90e10673506839b002442c62a16fe0f8641a8dded28bb157c8077
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-twm 9af54a6f5a54bce39f16263431d909207f6cf5afec214246793eda667c649f15
